{"In fetch_error_details, error_ids are zipped with nodestore.get_multi(...).values(), but get_multi deduplicates IDs and merges cached results, so value ordering/length may not correspond to error_ids, causing wrong title/message to be attached to an error_id or silently dropping duplicate IDs": 0.8938040733337402, "Endpoint imports Event and Project directly in the API endpoint module, violating the guideline to avoid direct model imports in API/endpoint code": 0.27772924304008484, "FeedbackSummary component is missing a colocated .spec.tsx test file, violating the requirement for colocated tests for new UI components": 0.2758932411670685, "useFeedbackSummary hook is missing a colocated .spec.tsx test file, violating the colocated testing requirement": 0.23132741451263428, "BrowserReportSerializer.validate_timestamp/validate_age use truthiness checks so age=0 or timestamp=0 will not be detected and both fields can be provided simultaneously, breaking the intended mutual-exclusion validation": 0.9612607359886169, "_truncate_title slices the title to ISSUE_TITLE_MAX_LENGTH and then appends '...', producing titles longer than ISSUE_TITLE_MAX_LENGTH (53 characters instead of 50)": 0.8871806263923645}